"/arc-plc/texas/ellis-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025 that same pair landed at 53% of normal, while June to July 2025 ran 173%. Grid 14833 had its driest year in 1963, at 51% of normal.</p>"}
